OL,3,ALondon housing project wins top
OL,4,Aarchitecture award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suburban housing development in south
OL,7,FLondon has won the UK's most
OL,8,Fprestigious architecture award, with
OL,9,Fjudges praising its sensitive design
OL,10,Fand integration into the surrounding
OL,11,Flandscape.
OL,13,FLion Green Road in Coulsdon, comprising
OL,14,F157 homes across five distinctive
OL,15,F13-sided blocks, was named winner of
OL,16,Fthe 2026 Stirling Prize by the Royal
OL,17,FInstitute of British Architects (Riba).
OL,19,FDesigned by Mary Duggan Architects and
OL,20,Fbuilt with RUFF Architects, it combines
OL,21,Faffordable and private housing for
OL,22,FCroydon Council.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
